        "original_id": "47b0056c-e2e2-585d-a96c-ef9078748813",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Good Luck Charlie, It's Christmas!, Good Luck Charlie: The Road Trip Movie, Good Luck Charlie\n- People: Arlene Sanford, Geoff Rodkey, Bridgit Mendler, Leigh-Allyn Baker, Bradley Steven Perry, Mia Talerico, Eric Allan Kramer, Jason Dolley\n- Roles: director, writer, actor\n- Places: United Kingdom, Ireland\n\nFacts:\n- Eric Allan Kramer was born on March 26, 1962, and he is an American-Canadian character actor.\n- Good Luck Charlie, It's Christmas! is a 2011 Christmas film based on the Disney Channel Original Series Good Luck Charlie.\n- Good Luck Charlie, It's Christmas! is also known in the United Kingdom and Ireland as Good Luck Charlie: The Road Trip Movie.\n- Good Luck Charlie, It's Christmas! was directed by Arlene Sanford and written by Geoff Rodkey.\n- Good Luck Charlie, It's Christmas! stars Bridgit Mendler, Leigh-Allyn Baker, Bradley Steven Perry, Mia Talerico, Eric Allan Kramer, and Jason Dolley as the Duncan family.",
